    "Id": "vehicledef_HARASSER_FLAMER_2",
    "Name": "Harasser (2875)",
    "Details": "This specialized 2875 variant picks up where the 2851 model left off. One SRM is dropped entirely to mount Heavy Flamers. The Harasser was extremely cheap to manufacture, and was produced in large numbers, as it was incorporated into the Galleon Light Tank units within the Free World League. Many variants have subsequently been produced.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar or Martian biomes due to using an ICE.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 10/15 hexes / 300/450 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>        60     15\n<b>Left</b>          55     15\n<b>Right</b>        55     15\n<b>Rear</b>         50     15\n<b>Turret</b>       40     15\n\n<b>Total</b>      260     75</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color>",
    "Icon": "Harasser"
  },
